> 3.1 Cross-Sectional Methods
> A first line of inquiry compares outcomes across locations with different climates (for example,
> Mendelsohn, Nordhaus and Shaw, 1994; Nordhaus, 2006; Dell, Jones and Olken, 2009; Albouy
> et al., 2016), estimating regressions along the lines of:
